tform-3099][multicheckbox-1][]\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"Microsoft Teams\"/> <span>Microsoft Teams</span> </label> </div> <div class=\"form-check\"> <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"mainContactform-3099-multicheckbox-1-3\"> <input id=\"mainContactform-3099-multicheckbox-1-3\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][multicheckbox-1][]\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"Besuch der ZOLLER Smart Factory\"/> <span>Besuch der ZOLLER Smart Factory</span> </label> </div> <div class=\"form-check\"> <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"mainContactform-3099-multicheckbox-1-4\"> <input id=\"mainContactform-3099-multicheckbox-1-4\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][multicheckbox-1][]\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"Schulungen\"/> <span>Schulungen</span> </label> </div> <div class=\"form-check\"> <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"mainContactform-3099-multicheckbox-1-5\"> <input id=\"mainContactform-3099-multicheckbox-1-5\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][multicheckbox-1][]\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"Dienstleistung\"/> <span>Dienstleistung</span> </label> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"mainContactform-3099-textarea-1\">Ihre Nachricht</label> <div class=\"input\"> <textarea class=\"xxlarge form-control\" id=\"mainContactform-3099-textarea-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][textarea-1]\"></textarea> </div> </div> </fieldset> <fieldset class=\"form-group\" id=\"mainContactform-3099-fieldset-2\"> <div class=\"form-group\"> <div class=\"input checkbox\"> <div class=\"form-check\"> <label class=\"add-on form-check-label\" for=\"mainContactform-3099-checkbox-2\"> <input name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][checkbox-2]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\"/><input class=\"add-on\" id=\"mainContactform-3099-checkbox-2\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][checkbox-2]\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/> <span>Ich möchte den Newsletter abonnieren.</span> </label> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"form-group\"> <div class=\"input checkbox\"> <div class=\"form-check\"> <label class=\"add-on form-check-label\" for=\"mainContactform-3099-checkbox-1\"> <input name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][checkbox-1]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\"/><input class=\"add-on\" id=\"mainContactform-3099-checkbox-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][checkbox-1]\" required=\"required\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/> <span>Sie sind einverstanden, dass die oben eingetragenen Daten zur Bearbeitung Ihrer Anfrage für Vertriebsaktivitäten verwendet und an die zuständigen Vertriebsniederlassungen bzw. Handelsvertreter weitergeben werden. Einer Datenverarbeitung können Sie jederzeit ohne Angabe von Gründen unter datenschutz@zoller.info widersprechen. <span class=\"required\">*</span> </span> </label> </div> </div> </div> </fieldset> <div class=\"form-group\"> <div class=\"recaptcha\"> <input data-recaptcha-form-field=\"\" id=\"mainContactform-3099-recaptcha-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][recaptcha-1]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\"/> <div class=\"g-recaptcha\" data-callback=\"onRecaptchaCallback\" data-error-callback=\"onRecaptchaError\" data-expired-callback=\"onRecaptchaExpired\" data-sitekey=\"6LcINbosAAAAAH8zSxnwOP319AslujYzyd6BWf7L\"></div> </div> </div> <div class=\"actions\"> <nav class=\"form-navigation\"> <div class=\"btn-toolbar\" role=\"toolbar\"> <div class=\"btn-group\" role=\"group\"> <span class=\"btn-group next submit\"> <button class=\"block-button\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][__currentPage]\" type=\"submit\" value=\"1\"> E-Mail senden </button> </span> </div> </div> </nav> </div> </form>",
